# The index helper's resource use: a button in the title bar while the helper runs, its rich tip, and the
# rows on the Search index page of Settings. The harness's index is posed: no helper is started.

settle
assert-hidden IndexerButton

pose-indexer running
assert-visible IndexerButton
shot 01-title-bar TitleBarRoot

tip IndexerButton
assert-tip Search index helper
assert-tip Memory: 86 MB
assert-tip CPU: 0.4%
assert-tip Disk read: 1.2 MB/s 3.323 GB total
assert-tip Click for the Search index settings
shot 02-tip

press IndexerButton
settle
assert-visible IndexerUsageHeading
assert-visible IndexerUsage.memory
assert-visible IndexerUsage.pid
assert-visible IndexerUsage.read.detail
shot 03-settings
settings close

pose-indexer off
assert-hidden IndexerButton
shot 04-off TitleBarRoot
